<form class="hsn-editor-form"><header><h1>Configurações do HoloNews</h1><p>Estas opções alteram apenas a experiência publicada.</p></header><div class="hsn-form-grid"><label class="hsn-span-2">Publicação padrão<select name="defaultPublicationId"><option value="">Primeira disponível</option>{{#each publications}}<option value="{{id}}" {{hsnSelected id ../settings.defaultPublicationId}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Localidade<input name="locale" value="{{settings.locale}}" placeholder="pt-BR"></label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="showViews" {{hsnChecked settings.showViews}}> Mostrar views</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="showAuthors" {{hsnChecked settings.showAuthors}}> Mostrar autores</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="showDates" {{hsnChecked settings.showDates}}> Mostrar datas</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="showArchive" {{hsnChecked settings.showArchive}}> Mostrar arquivo</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="allowSearch" {{hsnChecked settings.allowSearch}}> Permitir busca</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="showBadges" {{hsnChecked settings.showBadges}}> Mostrar badges</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="openLatestAutomatically" {{hsnChecked settings.openLatestAutomatically}}> Abrir última edição</label><label class="hsn-check"><input type="checkbox" name="markAsRead" {{hsnChecked settings.markAsRead}}> Marcar como lida</label></div><footer><button type="submit" class="hsn-primary">Salvar configurações</button></footer></form>
